    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_026f972bc8c1cd669b66",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 83,
      "text": "# 二、包含微分关系键合图模型系统状态方程列写;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e1e9b65700d5b61ab44d",
      "document_start": 84,
      "document_end": 116,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9ffc26fe08c12a7a4818",
      "document_start": 118,
      "document_end": 178,
      "text": "（主要是转换器）及摩阻元件本身表现为其元件特性是系统状态变量的函数，而这系统状态变量中，又主要体现为系统某些位变的函数。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d13c3c9daafab6234f33",
      "document_start": 178,
      "document_end": 264,
      "text": "因此在大多数情况下，自动机和大部分机械系统的键合图模型中的转换器、摩阻元件甚至于阻性元件的特性表现为系统状态空间的函数，在解状态方程之前，它们可通过运动学关系的分析而求解。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_215783b0d9cbba6833cd",
      "document_start": 266,
      "document_end": 286,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4325c2c27eefb5dc1ffe",
      "document_start": 287,
      "document_end": 311,
      "text": "# 二、包含微分关系键合图模型系统状态方程列写;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_df624f445525950c3030",
      "document_start": 312,
      "document_end": 344,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3dc8103b56fd1430a477",
      "document_start": 346,
      "document_end": 455,
      "text": "相对全积分关系的键合图模型来讲，带微分关系键合图模型的状态方程的列写比较麻烦，特别对于包含大量需要对转换器、回转器和摩阻元件的特性表示为系统状态空间的函数进行大量预处理的自动机和复杂机械系统来讲，其列写过程就更为复杂。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d2557c24b51c74da2ff3",
      "document_start": 455,
      "document_end": 517,
      "text": "通常可以把包含微分关系的键合图模型状态方程的列写归纳如下：确定系统模型中具有积分关系的能量元件的能量变量作为系统的状态变量；",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1816b006f59502d4b206",
      "document_start": 517,
      "document_end": 536,
      "text": "按系统的势源和流源确定系统的输入变量；",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_492e9acd3ca4d0b33aab",
      "document_start": 536,
      "document_end": 560,
      "text": "求出具有积分关系的能量元件和阻性元件的输出变量；",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_beb90990fac746854f16",
      "document_start": 560,
      "document_end": 626,
      "text": "根据系统构成特点，确定具有微分关系能量元件的能量变量和系统状态变量的关系，把它们表示为某种函数，并将这种函数表达式对时间作一次导数；",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9583c8fbeb639c3c45bc",
      "document_start": 626,
      "document_end": 657,
      "text": "列写出各能量元件的能量变量对时间导数的势方程和流方程的表达式；",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a13f06ad69120e362063",
      "document_start": 657,
      "document_end": 679,
      "text": "对状态方程进行化简，得到状态方程的最终形式。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a122396a2beca16609b9",
      "document_start": 681,
      "document_end": 701,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9cd80e5e8ff416f08bee",
      "document_start": 702,
      "document_end": 719,
      "text": "# 5.3 键合空间系统碰撞理论;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a6a7395853479b986142",
      "document_start": 720,
      "document_end": 752,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0d78a8be2f3416e991ae",
      "document_start": 754,
      "document_end": 815,
      "text": "碰撞是自动机的机构运动中的一种常见运动形式，因此要应用键合图理论对自动机进行表述，就必然涉及碰撞的键合图表示和应用的问题。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f60ad52d88ad8ad4bcf8",
      "document_start": 815,
      "document_end": 873,
      "text": "由于碰撞发生的过程相对于自动机的运动来讲，是极其短暂的过程，因此在研究碰撞时，把它视为在一个瞬时发生的系统状态突变。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a9f9a2cd068edd2b8e57",
      "document_start": 875,
      "document_end": 895,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a8822d14893d29228920",
      "document_start": 896,
      "document_end": 921,
      "text": "# 5.3.2 系统刚性连接和碰撞在系统中的传递;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4eaf300e51f3fe142ccd",
      "document_start": 922,
      "document_end": 954,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0e881421d1902719d7d6",
      "document_start": 956,
      "document_end": 1018,
      "text": "前面已经讲过，通常惯性元件间是通过键、结和连通元件连接，而通常也把摩阻元件视为一种连通元件，下面考察连通元件传递碰撞的情况。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5dae6c4daba8bd884d6d",
      "document_start": 1020,
      "document_end": 1040,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b083a14a4a910804e2c0",
      "document_start": 1041,
      "document_end": 1058,
      "text": "# （二）确定可以变化输入的参数;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_56323aeb701a8ad41490",
      "document_start": 1059,
      "document_end": 1091,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6debc46d8a7a907a7893",
      "document_start": 1093,
      "document_end": 1115,
      "text": "为了实现上述目的，确定了可以变化输入的参数。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_757d2dd1d9a67931f6ba",
      "document_start": 1115,
      "document_end": 1167,
      "text": "主要有：弹簧马达相关参数，提弹数，弹簧马达电机减速器速比，传动系统的等效阻尼、传动效率、转动惯量等参数。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4e3a335fdbc5dafd62d0",
      "document_start": 1169,
      "document_end": 1189,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2d9b59b5bf201957a54f",
      "document_start": 1190,
      "document_end": 1212,
      "text": "# （一）后坐加速开门阶段自动机动力学模型;",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2df70d7761ca8ed17848",
      "document_start": 1213,
      "document_end": 1245,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8aeb63003a3bb822f04c",
      "document_start": 1247,
      "document_end": 1284,
      "text": "此模型中只有身管组的运动为独立的运动，身管组和闩座组之间靠开闩加速臂连接。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d844642e50a023e28ce3",
      "document_start": 1284,
      "document_end": 1316,
      "text": "根据键合空间理论建立此阶段自动机键合空间模型如图5.4.8所示。",
      "section_id": "section_f8bdd5e59de7"
    }
  ],
